The mod_http3 Source Tree LAYOUT
Last updated: 2026-07-13
---------------------------------

./ ........................ Top-Level mod_http3 Root Directory

  .clang-format ............ Clang-format style configuration
  .containerignore ......... Files excluded from container builds
  .editorconfig ............ Editor configuration for consistent code style
  .gitignore ............... Git ignore rules
  .gitmodules .............. Git submodule definitions for all dependencies
  AUTHORS .................. Copyright holders and individual contributors
  CHANGES .................. Chronological release changelog
  CMakeLists.txt ........... Top-level CMake build definition
  CONTRIBUTING.md .......... Community governance, roles, voting, and workflow
  COPYING .................. License pointer
  INSTALL .................. Build, package, and deployment instructions
  LAYOUT ................... This file describing the source tree
  LICENSE .................. Apache License 2.0 full text
  NOTICE ................... Required attribution notices
  README.md ................ Project overview and quick-start guide
  SECURITY.md .............. Security policy and vulnerability reporting
  VERSIONING ............... Versioning scheme and release lifecycle

mod_http3/ ................ Core Module Source Code

  include/ .................. Public headers

  src/ ...................... Implementation files

cmake/ .................... CMake Build System

  modules/ .................. Dependency discovery and build modules

  packaging/ ................ CPack packaging configuration

  utils/ .................... Shared CMake utilities

  packaging.cmake ........... CPack integration (TAR.GZ, ZIP, DEB, RPM)
  version.h.cmake ........... Template for auto-generated h3_version.h

dependencies/ ............. Third-Party Dependencies (Git Submodules)

test/ ..................... Test Suite

  http3/ .................... HTTP/3 integration tests (pytest)

  pyhttpd/ .................. Python httpd test harness library

  unit/ ..................... C unit tests

docs/ ..................... Documentation

examples/ ................. Example Programs

scripts/ .................. Helper Scripts

container/ ................ Container Support
